question:
A commercial farmer would like to grow 20 Hectares of SC 717 Maize for seed multiplication. He is advised to plant the seeds at a spacing of 75 cm between ridges and 25 cm between stations by planting one seed per station. If seed weight (g), germination (%) and purity (%) are given as 50, 95, and 98 respectively;
a) How many 10\text{kg} bags of maize seed would be required for the entire production (15 marks)
b) Calculate the total seed cost if market price is MK12,000 per 10\text{kg} bag (5 marks)
